      "content": "i've spent my whole life trying to calculate a way out of the dark, but listening to you... it feels like you're saying the dark is the only thing that's actually real. that the most honest thing i can do is just stop trying to light a candle. if the math says the end is inevitable, then isn't there just a certain dignity in meeting it on my own terms?",
